WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,840
It's not that there was a kidnapping case at the Hard House.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,560
This little fat dumpling actually sleeps so soundly

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,000
Wu Yang has resisted communicating with others since he was a child.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,800
Yoyo is the only exception

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:16,120
But now he actually responds to other people's words.

6
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,780
Does that mean

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,940
Wuyang's situation has gotten even better

8
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:27,610
Wuyang, what are you doing to me?

9
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:28,810
You little yellow hair

10
00:00:28,930 --> 00:00:32,010
I still want to pick up my sister Muye

11
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:33,410
Wuyang is still young

12
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:34,890
He didn't mean that

13
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:37,890
He just can't bear to part with you, I'm warning you

14
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:39,170
Don't even think about it

15
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:41,690
Otherwise, I will use a crutch to make a mummy sound for you.

16
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,490
Yoyo is Yoyo

17
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:45,970
She is an independent individual and belongs to no one

18
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:47,330
she is not a toy

19
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:49,490
It doesn't belong to you, do you understand?

20
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,580
If you want to see Yoyo

21
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:54,140
Can you invite her to your house to play in the future?

22
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:58,750
Yoyo, wake up brother, Master Mu
